#clone repository and enter "tor" directory
extract, ./configure, and make both tor versions

#configure
add ReachableAddresses to client-torrc
fill the rest in from ting's configure script
(if not running w & z nodes locally, torrc-w & torrc-z are not needed)


configure tingrc (file in this repository)

#run daemons

python echo_server 4444
./tor -f ~/tor/configs/torrc-client


#run ting
python ting [fp] [fp] --config ./tingrc



notes:
connectivity to both W & Z relays are required, as well as connectivity to a couple of directory authorities (not tor26 though, due to an unknown ssl error)
this connectivity must be specified both in the ReachableAddresses parameter and the DETER allowed connecvitity.
